  "body": "Some homes impress with their scale. Others with their craftsmanship. Very few achieve both while remaining effortlessly liveable. Designed by renowned architect Macfie Architecture and meticulously built by ONFORM, this remarkable residence has won multiple awards and sets a new benchmark for contemporary family living in one of St Heliers' most prestigious addresses.\r\n\r\nOccupying a private, elevated site, the home has been thoughtfully engineered to maximise natural light, privacy and seamless indoor-outdoor living. Spanning nearly 500sqm, every space has been carefully considered to create a home that feels equally suited to grand-scale entertaining, relaxed family life and quiet everyday enjoyment.\r\n\r\nAt its heart, generous interconnected living areas flow effortlessly to a resort-inspired outdoor setting where a heated swimming pool, expansive entertaining terraces and beautifully landscaped gardens combine to create a true sanctuary. Whether hosting large gatherings or enjoying a quiet evening with family, the home delivers an enviable lifestyle rarely found in a new build.\r\n\r\nAccommodation has been designed with flexibility in mind, providing generous family spaces together with versatile rooms that can effortlessly adapt for guests, teenagers, live-in support, working from home or wellness. Rather than dedicating space to rooms that may only be used occasionally, the home has been intelligently planned to ensure every square metre contributes to comfortable day-to-day living.\r\n\r\nThe level of craftsmanship extends far beyond what is immediately visible. From premium natural materials and bespoke joinery to integrated smart-home technology, climate control, and secure six-car garaging, every element has been selected to enhance the ownership experience. The result is a home that offers all the presence expected of a landmark residence, while remaining remarkably easy to lock up, leave and enjoy.\r\n\r\nPositioned within a short distance to St Heliers village, the waterfront and coastal walkways, this is a home that combines architectural integrity, enduring quality and an effortless lifestyle in one of Auckland's most tightly held seaside suburbs.\r\n\r\nBrand new and flawlessly executed, this is a rare opportunity to secure a residence where every detail has already been considered, allowing you to simply move in and enjoy a level of living that is both sophisticated and refreshingly uncomplicated.\r\n\r\nEnquiries over $8,000,000.\r\n\r\nViewing by appointment.",
